When Gellö Helados in Mexico started talking to me about their Gelato, it was obvious I was going to make one of their delicious gelato recipes. 
In this video, I take one of their Dulce de Leche gelato recipes and tweak it for home ice cream machines and WOW what a flavour it is. 
The full recipe is in the video and if you are happy to get some proper Argentina Dulce de Leche, you will not regret making gelato I promise. 

---------------------------

